// Potential QBot Activity | T1059.005 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-emerging-threats/2019/Malware/QBot/proc_creation_win_malware_qbot.yml
(process.parent.executable.caseless:*\\WinRAR.exe AND process.executable.caseless:*\\wscript.exe) OR process.command_line:*\ \/c\ ping.exe\ \-n\ 6\ 127.0.0.1\ \&\ type\ * OR (process.command_line:*regsvr32.exe* AND process.command_line:*C\:\\ProgramData* AND process.command_line:*.tmp*)
